    "title": "TeamSnap: manage youth sports",
    "description": "Join the millions of users who love TeamSnap. The all-in-one platform streamlines coordination between coaches and parents through communication, scheduling, invoicing and more. \r\n\r\nONE APP TO MANAGE IT ALL\r\nTeamSnap simplifies the coordination of recreational and competitive sports, including soccer, hockey, baseball, softball, basketball, football, lacrosse, volleyball and 100s more. Our fan-favorite features include:\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Scheduling: A single source for all game, practice and event details that syncs with your favorite calendar apps\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Communication: Send messages to your entire team or select groups; let players know about last-minute changes with push notifications or text messages\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0e Assignments: Stay on top of volunteer assignments, tasks and signups\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0e And more depending on team needs!\r\n\r\nCHOOSE THE PLAN THAT\u2019S RIGHT FOR YOU\r\nFrom team messaging, scheduling and assignments to last-minute alerts, real-time game sharing and invoicing, we offer a variety of features and plans tailored to fit your needs\u2014starting with FREE.\r\nPlus, new teams receive a 21-day free trial to test drive our Premium-level features.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD THE TEAMSNAP APP TODAY!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.teamsnap.com/terms  | https://www.teamsnap.com/privacy-policy",
